WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.176
Strong cosmic censorship near Kerr.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.611
Continuous extensions past the horizon exist. The

3
00:00:05.611 --> 00:00:08.020
question is whether smoother ones do.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.027
If one existed, tiny loops force curvature

5
00:00:11.027 --> 00:00:13.253
small; a late wave makes it large.

6
00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.474
Claimed: typical nearby data allow none.

7
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:18.635
No Lean check.
